# Keep the build context byte-identical to what scripts/build_images.py
# hashes (tree_hash skips __pycache__): stray host bytecode must never leak
# into the image or make the content-hash label lie about image content.
# NOTE: .dockerignore patterns anchor at the context root, so nested
# directories need the **/ prefix (plain `__pycache__/` would only match a
# top-level directory, not control/__pycache__).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
